## Q: Show Granite Goods' overdue invoices by customer
status=COMPLETED  (16.6s)
Genie: You want to see the overdue invoices for Granite Goods, broken down by each customer name.
SQL:
SELECT
  i.`customer_name`,
  COUNT(*) AS `overdue_invoice_count`,
  ROUND(SUM(i.`amount`)) AS `overdue_amount`
FROM `serverless_stable_0dcqtv_catalog`.`smb_cashflow`.`silver_invoices` i
INNER JOIN `serverless_stable_0dcqtv_catalog`.`smb_cashflow`.`account_cashflow_health` a
  ON i.`account_id` = a.`account_id`
WHERE a.`business_name` ILIKE '%Granite Goods%'
  AND i.`status` = 'overdue'
  AND i.`customer_name` IS NOT NULL
  AND i.`amount` IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY i.`customer_name`
ORDER BY SUM(i.`amount`) DESC, i.`customer_name` ASC
Result: customer_name | overdue_invoice_count | overdue_amount
   Stark Retail | 3 | 42550.0
   Globex | 2 | 18950.0
   Vandelay Industries | 1 | 12800.0
   Initech | 1 | 8740.0
   Hooli | 1 | 6000.0
   (5 rows)
